    "architecture": "Flux-dev img2img with per-step pixel-manifold projection (PixelManifoldProjection patch + PixelQuantize final render)",
    "summary": "The diffusion pixelizer: redraws an image into clean pixel art while clamping the x0 estimate onto a fixed grid+palette every denoise step. Flux-dev is a neutral high-fidelity denoiser (it does not author the art); low strength + strong projection ramp let the quantizer lead. API-only.",
